Description
This database records the user’s state on a daily basis. It also keeps track of therapists they’ve been connected with, their health history, goals and recommendations. 

Proposed Tables
user_sleep (records how the user’s sleep was)
sleep_id 
sleep_quality_rating
sleep_description
sleep_duration 
mood (records the user’s mood i.e. anger, depression, etc.)
mood_id 
mood_description 
mood_severity
physical_symptoms (records user’s physical state i.e. fatigue, lack of appetite, etc.)
symptom_id 
symptom_description 
symptom_severity 
journal_entries (daily log for user)
journal_id 
user_id 
sleep_id
mood_id
